        "Id": 177,
        "ActionId": 177,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 178,
        "ActionId": 178,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Bambinata",
            "It hurts every time, but Bambinata doesn't know why Mistress knows about this.",
